    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 Embark on Your Epic Saga</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a grand journey across 45 captivating levels filled with adventure, danger, and the thrill of heroism. Your quest to save the kingdom is packed with excitement and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Strategic Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your problem-solving skills to the test with intricate puzzles that will challenge your wits and keep you engaged as you progress through the quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Intense Beat 'Em Up Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inbetween puzzle based stages you have the opportunity to unleash your combat prowess in action-packed stages. Face off against fierce enemies in thrilling beat 'em up encounters that will keep your adrenaline pumping.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Delightful Mini Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the main quest with fun and refreshing mini-games. These entertaining diversions offer a perfect balance to your epic adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddb9 Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront and defeat formidable bosses in heart-pounding showdowns. Each victory brings you closer to recovering the Queen\u2019s precious jewels and saving the kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
